OL,3,GNEWSAStained glass artist's appeal for
OL,4,A'endangered craft'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artist is hoping to inspire others
OL,7,Fto take up stained glass-making to help
OL,8,Fpreserve the craft and its creations
OL,9,Ffor future generations.
OL,11,FNathalie Hildegarde Liege, a stained
OL,12,Fglass artist for about 30 years, has
OL,13,Flaunched a crowdfunding appeal to
OL,14,Fcreate a library and study room at her
OL,15,Fstudio in Wem, Shropshire.
OL,17,FShe hopes to raise #5,000 by 13
OL,18,FNovember to create a "haven for future
OL,19,Fprofessionals and the wider public".
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
