OL,3,GNEWSAStained glass artist's appeal for
OL,4,A'endangered craft'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are listed as an endangered craft.
OL,7,FThere's no time to waste really," she
OL,8,Fsaid, adding the skills could "vanish".
